LRC column/row mode atlas (codex-2026-05-31 S411)

1. UNIT SKELETON ON ODD +2 CHAINS AND EVEN *2 CHAINS
======================================================================================
Initial LRC segments leave unit endpoints.  Along n=2^r*b, b odd:
  r=0 -> r=1: phi(2b)=phi(b), so the first doubling has seam defect phi(b)
  r>=1:       phi(2^(r+1)b)=2*phi(2^r b)

