6. PRODUCT-SUM OVERLAY NEAR THE LRC FRONTIER
======================================================================================
The +2/additive chain supplies slack; multiplication supplies sparse
factor cores.  At LRC denominator n, use arity k=n-1.

  n   state      k   min product  seed
  12  2^2*3     11          16  1^8+2*2*4
  13  2^0*13    12          16  1^8+2*2*2*2
